Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:14.49,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(80,1020)\clip(m 438 1080 b 439 1068 441 1049 442 1039 443 1029 446 1008 447 998 448 995 449 987 450 984 451 977 454 963 455 956 456 949 458 936 460 930 460 925 462 917 463 912 463 909 464 900 465 900 371 900 183 900 0 900 0 944 0 1033 0 1080)\blur5}初めて選んだ言葉があるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.49,0:02:19.87,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(80,1020)\blur5}初めて選んだ言葉があるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.87,0:02:25.62,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\t(873,873,\alpha&H00&\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&)\t(4752,4917,\c&H000000&\1a&HAA&)\blur5}震えることも美しく見えるの
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.62,0:02:28.42,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,240)\blur5}だから大丈夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.42,0:02:31.34,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,0)\blur5\t(790,790,\alpha&HFF&)}醜さも私
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.34,0:02:32.75,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,240)\blur5}教えて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.75,0:02:36.97,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(504,240)\blur5}あなたは愛を知らされて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.97,0:02:42.64,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}抱きしめきれない闇の大きさに
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:48.02,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,625)\blur5}少し笑って　どこまで進むの？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:55.07,OP - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,877)\an1\pos(980,1071)\fs55\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\blur5}灯火のような幸せの日を追いかけて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:55.07,OP - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,877)\an2\pos(960,1075)\fs67\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\blur5}|
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.36,0:21:45.29,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.5}我能就像現在這樣嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:46.98,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}好想被愛
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.98,0:21:53.39,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5}哪怕拋下我所熟悉的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.86,0:21:57.08,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}從未和他人拼湊在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.08,0:21:59.89,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}訴說著話語  卻無法溝通
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.89,0:22:02.86,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}無法融入這世界的「理所當然」
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.86,0:22:05.14,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5}也找不到歸處
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.27,0:22:08.35,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.5}沒有人同我心意相通
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.35,0:22:10.90,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}總是顧及別人的視線
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.90,0:22:13.79,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}不停地  不停地
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.79,0:22:16.28,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}在自己身上塗改
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.28,0:22:19.41,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}寫下我的名字  刻在心裡
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.41,0:22:23.45,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}將那個不能做自己的我
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.61,0:22:29.71,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5}留在過去
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.25,0:22:36.06,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5\fs55}我要做我自己
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.06,0:22:38.38,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5\fs55}跨越每一片大海  自由地奔跑
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.38,0:22:41.52,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5\fs55}離開這逼仄的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.52,0:22:47.48,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5\fs55}渴求著愛而顫抖著的心
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.60,0:22:51.60,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.5\fs55}將因照耀著明日的你
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.30,0:22:54.65,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}而熠熠生輝
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.57,0:23:05.33,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5}我也一定會是某個人的光
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.36,0:21:45.29,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.5}私は私のままで良いかな？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:46.98,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}愛されたい
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.98,0:21:53.39,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5}自分の知る世界を手放しても
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.86,0:21:57.08,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.08,0:21:59.89,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.89,0:22:02.86,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.86,0:22:05.14,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.27,0:22:08.35,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.5}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.35,0:22:10.90,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.90,0:22:13.79,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.79,0:22:16.28,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.28,0:22:19.41,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.41,0:22:23.45,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.61,0:22:29.71,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.25,0:22:36.06,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5\fs60}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.06,0:22:38.38,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5\fs60}Crossing every sea, running free
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.38,0:22:41.52,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5\fs60}狭い世界離れて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.52,0:22:47.48,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5\fs60}愛されたくて　ふるえる心は
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.60,0:22:51.60,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.5\fs60}明日を照らす君だけの
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.30,0:22:54.65,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}it's your wild glow
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.57,0:23:05.33,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5}きっと誰かの光だから
